<h1>Is a 90cm silk scarf too big for you?</h1>\n<p class=\"byline\">The ASYII Team</p>\n<p class=\"toc\"><a href=\"#petite\">1. petite frame</a> · <a href=\"#one\">2. buying only one</a> · <a href=\"#small\">3. travel</a> · <a href=\"#shawl\">4. shawl</a></p>\n<p class=\"lead\"><b>Usually no.</b> 90cm is the most useful size precisely because it can be folded down. Whether it is too big depends on what you want it to do — not on your frame.</p><p class=\"lead\">Find your situation below and start there.</p>\n<h2 id=\"petite\">You're petite and think 90cm will swallow you</h2>\n<p>It is the most common worry, and the answer is that 90cm is easier to make smaller than 45cm is to make bigger.</p><p>A large square folds into a neat neck scarf. Start small if you want to test the idea, but do not rule out 90cm on frame size alone.</p>\n<div class=\"products\">\n{% assign prod = all_products['bloom-corner-45cm-hand-rolled-silk-twill-scarf-with-double-face-printed'] %}\n<div class=\"product\">\n<a class=\"pimg\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"{{ prod.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}\" alt=\"Bloom Corner 45cm hand-rolled silk square\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n<div class=\"pmeta\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<span class=\"off\">{% assign pct = prod.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: prod.compare_at_price | round %}{{ 100 | minus: pct }}% off</span>{% endif %}<span class=\"variant\">Floral · 45cm</span></div>\n<a class=\"pname\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bloom Corner 45cm hand-rolled silk square</a>\n<p class=\"ppick\"><b>Pick this if</b> You want the smallest piece that still feels properly made.</p>\n<div class=\"pprice\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<s>{{ prod.compare_at_price | money }}</s> {% endif %}<b>{{ prod.price | money }}</b></div>\n<a class=\"plink\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">See this piece →</a></div>\n{% assign prod = all_products['printed-abstract-floral-silk-twill-square'] %}\n<div class=\"product\">\n<a class=\"pimg\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"{{ prod.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}\" alt=\"Printed abstract floral silk twill square\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n<div class=\"pmeta\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<span class=\"off\">{% assign pct = prod.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: prod.compare_at_price | round %}{{ 100 | minus: pct }}% off</span>{% endif %}<span class=\"variant\">Printed · silk twill</span></div>\n<a class=\"pname\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Printed abstract floral silk twill square</a>\n<p class=\"ppick\"><b>Pick this if</b> You want a mid-size square you can wear several ways.</p>\n<div class=\"pprice\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<s>{{ prod.compare_at_price | money }}</s> {% endif %}<b>{{ prod.price | money }}</b></div>\n<a class=\"plink\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">See this piece →</a></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"pair\"><b>Pair with:</b> <a href=\"/blogs/asyii-diaries/how-to-choose-the-right-silk-scarf-size-45-70-90-cm\">the full size guide</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"one\">You only want to buy one</h2>\n<p>Then buy the size that does the most jobs. That is usually 90cm — neck, shoulders, hair, bag — because it can always be folded down.</p><p>This is the piece we would keep if we could keep only one.</p>\n<div class=\"products single\">\n{% assign prod = all_products['bloom-corner-90cm-hand-rolled-silk-twill-scarf-lily-of-the-valley-butterflies'] %}\n<div class=\"product feature\">\n<a class=\"pimg\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"{{ prod.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}\" alt=\"Bloom Corner 90cm hand-rolled silk square\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n<div class=\"pmeta\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<span class=\"off\">{% assign pct = prod.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: prod.compare_at_price | round %}{{ 100 | minus: pct }}% off</span>{% endif %}<span class=\"variant\">Lily of the valley · 90cm</span></div>\n<a class=\"pname\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bloom Corner 90cm hand-rolled silk square</a>\n<p class=\"ppick\"><b>Pick this if</b> This is the only silk square you plan to own.</p>\n<div class=\"pprice\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<s>{{ prod.compare_at_price | money }}</s> {% endif %}<b>{{ prod.price | money }}</b></div>\n<a class=\"plink\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">See this piece →</a></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"pair\"><b>Pair with:</b> <a href=\"/collections/statement-silk\">statement silk</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"small\">You want something small that travels</h2>\n<p>If the scarf lives in a handbag and gets tied quickly, a smaller format is easier to reach for than a big square.</p><p>Size matters less here than how easily it goes back in the bag without a fight.</p>\n<div class=\"products\">\n{% assign prod = all_products['garden-veil-silk-twilly-with-double-face-printed'] %}\n<div class=\"product\">\n<a class=\"pimg\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"{{ prod.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}\" alt=\"Garden Veil silk twilly\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n<div class=\"pmeta\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<span class=\"off\">{% assign pct = prod.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: prod.compare_at_price | round %}{{ 100 | minus: pct }}% off</span>{% endif %}<span class=\"variant\">Floral · twilly</span></div>\n<a class=\"pname\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Garden Veil silk twilly</a>\n<p class=\"ppick\"><b>Pick this if</b> You want the smallest thing to throw in a bag and tie neatly.</p>\n<div class=\"pprice\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<s>{{ prod.compare_at_price | money }}</s> {% endif %}<b>{{ prod.price | money }}</b></div>\n<a class=\"plink\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">See this piece →</a></div>\n{% assign prod = all_products['printed-floral-silk-twill-square-mint'] %}\n<div class=\"product\">\n<a class=\"pimg\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"{{ prod.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}\" alt=\"Printed floral silk twill square — Mint\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n<div class=\"pmeta\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<span class=\"off\">{% assign pct = prod.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: prod.compare_at_price | round %}{{ 100 | minus: pct }}% off</span>{% endif %}<span class=\"variant\">Mint · silk twill</span></div>\n<a class=\"pname\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Printed floral silk twill square — Mint</a>\n<p class=\"ppick\"><b>Pick this if</b> You want a quiet square that goes with a cream or grey wardrobe.</p>\n<div class=\"pprice\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<s>{{ prod.compare_at_price | money }}</s> {% endif %}<b>{{ prod.price | money }}</b></div>\n<a class=\"plink\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">See this piece →</a></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"pair\"><b>Pair with:</b> <a href=\"/collections/everyday-silk\">everyday silk</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"shawl\">You want it to work as a shawl or a top</h2>\n<p>This is where a 90cm square earns its keep — big enough to cover shoulders and to tie as a top.</p><p>A long wrap goes further again if coverage is the point.</p>\n<div class=\"products\">\n{% assign prod = all_products['garden-veil-90cm-hand-rolled-silk-square-scarf-with-double-face-printed'] %}\n<div class=\"product\">\n<a class=\"pimg\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"{{ prod.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}\" alt=\"Garden Veil 90cm hand-rolled silk square\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n<div class=\"pmeta\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<span class=\"off\">{% assign pct = prod.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: prod.compare_at_price | round %}{{ 100 | minus: pct }}% off</span>{% endif %}<span class=\"variant\">Floral · 90cm</span></div>\n<a class=\"pname\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Garden Veil 90cm hand-rolled silk square</a>\n<p class=\"ppick\"><b>Pick this if</b> You want one large enough to pull over your shoulders.</p>\n<div class=\"pprice\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<s>{{ prod.compare_at_price | money }}</s> {% endif %}<b>{{ prod.price | money }}</b></div>\n<a class=\"plink\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">See this piece →</a></div>\n{% assign prod = all_products['sweet-prelude-silk-wool-long-wrap'] %}\n<div class=\"product\">\n<a class=\"pimg\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"{{ prod.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}\" alt=\"Sweet Prelude silk-wool long wrap\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n<div class=\"pmeta\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<span class=\"off\">{% assign pct = prod.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: prod.compare_at_price | round %}{{ 100 | minus: pct }}% off</span>{% endif %}<span class=\"variant\">Limited edition · silk wool</span></div>\n<a class=\"pname\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sweet Prelude silk-wool long wrap</a>\n<p class=\"ppick\"><b>Pick this if</b> You want a shawl, not a square.</p>\n<div class=\"pprice\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<s>{{ prod.compare_at_price | money }}</s> {% endif %}<b>{{ prod.price | money }}</b></div>\n<a class=\"plink\" href=\"{{ prod.url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">See this piece →</a></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"pair\"><b>Pair with:</b> <a href=\"/collections/statement-silk\">statement silk</a></p>\n<section class=\"social\"><h2>There's more where this came from</h2><p>Most of what we make shows up here first — new pieces, the occasional look behind the scenes, and small notes on wearing silk. If that is your sort of thing,